    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JOB NAME\n\"Virgin America\"\nJob # 07/62\nPRODUCTION COMPANY\nTEAM HALPRIN\nTeam Halprin Inc.\n9190 W. Olympic Blvd. Suite 304\nBeverly Hills, CA 90212\n310-842-7000 Ph 310-842-7014 Fx\nLOCATION: FLIGHT PATH LEARNING CENTER MUSEUM\nABDRESS\n6661 W. IMPERIAL HWY LOS ANGELES, CA 90245\n405\nHotel:\nThe Fairmont Hotel\n101 Wilshire Blvd\nSanta Monica, CA 90401\n310.576.7777\n170\n405\n5\nPRODUCTION CONTACTS\nProduction Mgr. Mark Abbott, cell 213-952-4355.\nProducer: Susan Gross, cell: 310-729-3753\nAdditional Production Cells:\n310-666-6740, 310-666-6294\nL.A. THOMAS GUIDE PAGE\n702/F7\n5\n134\nWilshire Bivd.\n110\nOcean Ave\n4th St\n10\n10\nCentury BI.\nHotel:\nThe Westin Los Angeles Airport\n5400 W Century Blvd\n• Los Angeles, CA 90045\n310.216.5858\n5\nImperial Hwy.\n105\nDirections:\nLocation:\nFlight Path Learning Center Museum\n6661W Imperial Hwy\nLos Angeles, CA 90245\nTBG: 702/F7\nFrom The Westin Los Angeles Airport Hotel:\n1. Turn LEFT onto Century Bivd and follow approx. 1.2 Miles\nstaying in the RIGHT lanes and following signs to\n2. Turn LEFT onto Sepulveda Bld and follow approx.\n0.8 Miles staying to Imperial Hwy.\n3. Turn RIGHT on Imperial Hwy to the first LIGHT which is California.\n4. Turn RIGHT on at the light then make an IMMEDIATE LEFT\nonto the frontage road.and follow approx\n800 feet to the location on your RIGHT.\n5. Park as Directed by production.\nHOSPITAL\nPlease note:\nWe are filming on airport secure\nproperty. TSA requires everyone to\nshow acceptable proof of identification\nwith a Government issued photo\nI.D.,Drivers License or Passport to gain\naccess to the filming area. Do not forget\nto bring your identification or you will be\ndenied entry.\n1. Turn LEFT on Wilshire Blvd to 4th Street\n2. Turn RIGHT on 4th Street and travel approx. 0.7 to\nThe 10 Fwy. WEST.\n3. Take the 10 Fwy WEST approx. 3.4 Miles to the\n4. Take the 405 Fwy SOUTH approx. 7.9 Miles to the\n5. Take the 105 Fwy WEST approx. 2 Miles until it\nBecomes Imperial Hwy at California (1st Light).\n6. Turn RIGHT on California then make an IMMEDIATE\nLEFT onto the frontage road and travel 800 ft to\nlocation on your RIGHT,\n7. Park as Directed by Production.\nDaniel Freeman Memorial Medical Center 4650 Lincoln BI, Marina del Rey, CA (310) 823-8911 TBG: 672/B7",
      "america\nLAUNCH CAMPAIGN\nLOCATION STILLS PHOTOGRAPHY\nLOS ANGELES, CA\nSHOOT DATES: JANUARY 8 \u0026 9, 2008\nPHOTOGRAPHER: ROBERT WHITMAN\nAGENCY: ELEVEN INC.\nJOB # VAA-0006-07\nPRODUCTION: TEAM HALPRIN, INC.\nJOB # 07/62",
